      "message": "monoid is used for several things here, and while I can read the abstract definition of it, it\u0027s unclear to me how or why tags and draws need to be represented as monoids.\n\nIf this is internal Vello leaking up, we might want to avoid it, otherwise it might be helpful to summarize what\u0027s relevant to making a tag stream a monoid and similarly for a draw (vs. the original input stream data).",
      "range": {
